<title>USA: Science Applications wins information contract.</title>
<headline>Science Applications wins information contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense Department said Friday it has awarded a $285 million contract to Science Applications International Corp of San Diego, Calif. for work on a Defense Information Infrastructure Integration program.</p>
<p>It said the contract is for one year with options to continue each of an additional four years.</p>
